{"id":"dudoan-03","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-03/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":441.8,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.32,"text":"Section 3. You will hear a sociology student called John discussing his research project","words":[["Section",0.0,0.52],["3.",0.52,1.16],["You",2.28,2.62],["will",2.62,2.82],["hear",2.82,3.08],["a",3.08,3.42],["sociology",3.42,3.94],["student",3.94,4.82],["called",4.82,5.38],["John",5.38,5.86],["discussing",5.86,6.78],["his",6.78,7.2],["research",7.2,7.74],["project",7.74,8.32]]},{"start":8.32,"end":15.52,"text":"about the use of public services with his tutor. First, you have some time to look at","words":[["about",8.32,8.88],["the",8.88,9.14],["use",9.14,9.44],["of",9.44,9.7],["public",9.7,10.02],["services",10.02,10.64],["with",10.64,11.24],["his",11.24,11.5],["tutor.",11.5,11.82],["First,",12.86,13.4],["you",13.92,14.1],["have",14.1,14.32],["some",14.32,14.52],["time",14.52,14.92],["to",14.92,15.2],["look",15.2,15.36],["at",15.36,15.52]]},{"start":15.52,"end":70.56,"text":"questions 21 to 26 on page 5. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["questions",15.52,15.96],["21",15.96,17.12],["to",17.12,17.7],["26",17.7,18.36],["on",18.36,19.24],["page",19.24,19.48],["5.",19.48,20.0],["Now",65.64,66.04],["listen",66.04,66.38],["carefully",66.38,66.88],["and",66.88,67.5],["answer",67.5,67.82],["questions",67.82,68.32],["21",68.32,69.4],["to",69.4,69.94],["26.",69.94,70.56]]},{"start":74.01,"end":80.63,"text":"Hello, John. Come in and sit down. You're here to discuss your research project, are you?","words":[["Hello,",74.01,74.57],["John.",74.71,74.91],["Come",75.31,75.57],["in",75.57,75.77],["and",75.77,76.03],["sit",76.03,76.29],["down.",76.29,76.63],["You're",77.45,78.01],["here",78.01,78.23],["to",78.23,78.43],["discuss",78.43,78.81],["your",78.81,79.17],["research",79.17,79.61],["project,",79.61,80.25],["are",80.35,80.47],["you?",80.47,80.63]]},{"start":80.89,"end":85.33,"text":"Yes. I've more or less decided what to do, but I'd like your opinion.","words":[["Yes.",80.89,81.19],["I've",81.61,81.93],["more",81.93,82.13],["or",82.13,82.25],["less",82.25,82.43],["decided",82.43,82.89],["what",82.89,83.11],["to",83.11,83.35],["do,",83.35,83.59],["but",83.79,84.09],["I'd",84.09,84.57],["like",84.57,84.71],["your",84.71,84.95],["opinion.",84.95,85.33]]},{"start":85.79,"end":87.75,"text":"Fine. You've chosen a topic.","words":[["Fine.",85.79,86.13],["You've",86.63,87.07],["chosen",87.07,87.39],["a",87.39,87.51],["topic.",87.51,87.75]]},{"start":88.09,"end":92.85,"text":"Yes. I want to look at how people use public services in their local area.","words":[["Yes.",88.09,88.37],["I",89.01,89.15],["want",89.15,89.27],["to",89.27,89.43],["look",89.43,89.55],["at",89.55,89.71],["how",89.71,89.85],["people",89.85,90.21],["use",90.21,90.65],["public",90.65,90.99],["services",90.99,91.57],["in",91.57,91.87],["their",91.87,92.05],["local",92.05,92.33],["area.",92.33,92.85]]},{"start":93.29,"end":95.71,"text":"Things like parks and swimming pools.","words":[["Things",93.29,93.55],["like",93.55,93.81],["parks",93.81,94.45],["and",94.45,94.85],["swimming",94.85,95.19],["pools.",95.19,95.71]]},{"start":95.95,"end":101.47,"text":"Right. Well, the kind of information you'll get is very useful for town planning, of course.","words":[["Right.",95.95,96.21],["Well,",96.69,96.97],["the",97.25,97.35],["kind",97.35,97.55],["of",97.55,97.69],["information",97.69,98.07],["you'll",98.07,98.61],["get",98.61,98.89],["is",98.89,99.43],["very",99.43,99.69],["useful",99.69,100.13],["for",100.13,100.43],["town",100.43,100.67],["planning,",100.67,101.05],["of",101.15,101.25],["course.",101.25,101.47]]},{"start":101.47,"end":104.93,"text":"Do you have a special interest in public services?","words":[["Do",101.47,102.33],["you",102.33,102.51],["have",102.51,102.69],["a",102.69,102.81],["special",102.81,103.09],["interest",103.09,103.65],["in",103.65,104.07],["public",104.07,104.43],["services?",104.43,104.93]]},{"start":105.47,"end":109.47,"text":"Not really. It's just that I found a report in the college library","words":[["Not",105.47,105.73],["really.",105.73,106.11],["It's",106.69,107.09],["just",107.09,107.25],["that",107.25,107.45],["I",107.45,107.55],["found",107.55,107.83],["a",107.83,107.95],["report",107.95,108.35],["in",108.35,108.61],["the",108.61,108.73],["college",108.73,108.97],["library",108.97,109.47]]},{"start":109.47,"end":112.37,"text":"about an investigation that was done ten years ago,","words":[["about",109.47,109.85],["an",109.85,110.07],["investigation",110.07,110.45],["that",110.45,111.03],["was",111.03,111.21],["done",111.21,111.47],["ten",111.47,111.75],["years",111.75,112.03],["ago,",112.03,112.37]]},{"start":112.71,"end":115.51,"text":"and I thought it'd be interesting to do a parallel one.","words":[["and",112.71,113.05],["I",113.05,113.19],["thought",113.19,113.31],["it'd",113.31,113.57],["be",113.57,113.71],["interesting",113.71,114.17],["to",114.17,114.51],["do",114.51,114.63],["a",114.63,114.77],["parallel",114.77,115.11],["one.",115.11,115.51]]},{"start":116.27,"end":119.33,"text":"Ten years is a relatively short space of time.","words":[["Ten",116.27,116.81],["years",116.81,117.23],["is",117.23,117.41],["a",117.41,117.53],["relatively",117.53,117.91],["short",117.91,118.39],["space",118.39,118.67],["of",118.67,118.93],["time.",118.93,119.33]]},{"start":119.99,"end":121.31,"text":"What do you expect to find?","words":[["What",119.99,120.15],["do",120.15,120.29],["you",120.29,120.37],["expect",120.37,120.67],["to",120.67,120.95],["find?",120.95,121.31]]},{"start":122.01,"end":125.05,"text":"Do you think things will be more or less the same as before?","words":[["Do",122.01,122.27],["you",122.27,122.45],["think",122.45,122.67],["things",122.67,123.05],["will",123.05,123.25],["be",123.25,123.43],["more",123.43,123.79],["or",123.79,123.99],["less",123.99,124.19],["the",124.19,124.39],["same",124.39,124.63],["as",124.63,124.75],["before?",124.75,125.05]]},{"start":125.59,"end":127.43,"text":"I think there'll be some differences.","words":[["I",125.59,125.83],["think",125.83,126.03],["there'll",126.03,126.25],["be",126.25,126.41],["some",126.41,126.67],["differences.",126.67,127.43]]},{"start":127.43,"end":132.77,"text":"For example, I think the number of people going to the library will have decreased.","words":[["For",127.43,128.27],["example,",128.27,128.63],["I",129.17,129.35],["think",129.35,129.49],["the",129.49,129.63],["number",129.63,129.87],["of",129.87,130.07],["people",130.07,130.41],["going",130.41,130.73],["to",130.73,130.91],["the",130.91,131.05],["library",131.05,131.45],["will",131.45,131.93],["have",131.93,132.19],["decreased.",132.19,132.77]]},{"start":133.43,"end":138.57,"text":"And I'd guess that older people are using the Sports Centre more often than they're used","words":[["And",133.43,134.07],["I'd",134.07,134.29],["guess",134.29,134.61],["that",134.61,134.89],["older",134.89,135.25],["people",135.25,135.67],["are",135.67,136.03],["using",136.03,136.27],["the",136.27,136.49],["Sports",136.49,136.89],["Centre",136.89,137.33],["more",137.33,137.57],["often",137.57,137.97],["than",137.97,138.13],["they're",138.13,138.37],["used",138.37,138.57]]},{"start":138.57,"end":138.83,"text":"to.","words":[["to.",138.57,138.83]]},{"start":139.23,"end":139.57,"text":"Fine.","words":[["Fine.",139.23,139.57]]},{"start":139.99,"end":141.81,"text":"So those are your hypotheses.","words":[["So",139.99,140.27],["those",140.27,140.81],["are",140.81,141.03],["your",141.03,141.17],["hypotheses.",141.17,141.81]]},{"start":143.01,"end":146.17,"text":"Now what sort of data are you going to use?","words":[["Now",143.01,143.21],["what",143.21,143.75],["sort",143.75,144.13],["of",144.13,144.41],["data",144.41,144.77],["are",144.77,145.31],["you",145.31,145.49],["going",145.49,145.71],["to",145.71,145.89],["use?",145.89,146.17]]},{"start":146.73,"end":152.67,"text":"I was thinking of using official records from the management or the local council and","words":[["I",146.73,146.93],["was",146.93,147.09],["thinking",147.09,147.37],["of",147.37,147.61],["using",147.61,147.95],["official",147.95,148.39],["records",148.39,149.07],["from",149.07,149.63],["the",149.63,149.81],["management",149.81,150.19],["or",150.19,150.99],["the",150.99,151.19],["local",151.19,151.37],["council",151.37,151.91],["and",151.91,152.67]]},{"start":152.67,"end":153.57,"text":"analysing them.","words":[["analysing",152.67,153.39],["them.",153.39,153.57]]},{"start":154.13,"end":155.77,"text":"They should be easy to obtain.","words":[["They",154.13,154.41],["should",154.41,154.59],["be",154.59,154.79],["easy",154.79,155.03],["to",155.03,155.21],["obtain.",155.21,155.77]]},{"start":155.77,"end":159.29,"text":"I don't think that sort of information would be confidential.","words":[["I",155.77,156.31],["don't",156.31,156.87],["think",156.87,157.05],["that",157.05,157.27],["sort",157.27,157.47],["of",157.47,157.63],["information",157.63,158.05],["would",158.05,158.43],["be",158.43,158.63],["confidential.",158.63,159.29]]},{"start":159.85,"end":161.53,"text":"Yes, you're probably right.","words":[["Yes,",159.85,160.21],["you're",160.45,160.75],["probably",160.75,161.13],["right.",161.13,161.53]]},{"start":162.23,"end":164.97,"text":"There might not be as much information as you'd like,","words":[["There",162.23,162.45],["might",162.45,162.71],["not",162.71,162.89],["be",162.89,163.07],["as",163.07,163.19],["much",163.19,163.45],["information",163.45,163.97],["as",163.97,164.33],["you'd",164.33,164.59],["like,",164.59,164.97]]},{"start":165.21,"end":168.53,"text":"but it'd certainly be the easiest kind of data to work with.","words":[["but",165.21,165.43],["it'd",165.43,165.69],["certainly",165.69,166.09],["be",166.09,166.41],["the",166.41,166.55],["easiest",166.55,166.93],["kind",166.93,167.29],["of",167.29,167.41],["data",167.41,167.65],["to",167.65,167.89],["work",167.89,168.15],["with.",168.15,168.53]]},{"start":169.09,"end":172.13,"text":"But have you considered using a questionnaire as well?","words":[["But",169.09,169.45],["have",169.45,169.83],["you",169.83,170.03],["considered",170.03,170.51],["using",170.51,170.91],["a",170.91,171.11],["questionnaire",171.11,171.57],["as",171.57,171.89],["well?",171.89,172.13]]},{"start":172.69,"end":175.63,"text":"It's okay to get data from more than one source.","words":[["It's",172.69,173.21],["okay",173.21,173.55],["to",173.55,173.81],["get",173.81,173.95],["data",173.95,174.35],["from",174.35,174.61],["more",174.61,174.93],["than",174.93,175.09],["one",175.09,175.25],["source.",175.25,175.63]]},{"start":176.13,"end":178.11,"text":"Absolutely. It's a bonus.","words":[["Absolutely.",176.13,176.63],["It's",177.43,177.73],["a",177.73,177.81],["bonus.",177.81,178.11]]},{"start":178.79,"end":182.19,"text":"You've already done the module on questionnaire design, haven't you?","words":[["You've",178.79,179.17],["already",179.17,179.41],["done",179.41,179.73],["the",179.73,179.91],["module",179.91,180.29],["on",180.29,180.53],["questionnaire",180.53,181.01],["design,",181.01,181.61],["haven't",181.69,181.99],["you?",181.99,182.19]]},{"start":182.19,"end":187.75,"text":"And it'll be good to get experience, because next year you'll have to do something similar","words":[["And",182.19,183.01],["it'll",183.01,183.27],["be",183.27,183.39],["good",183.39,183.57],["to",183.57,183.73],["get",183.73,183.85],["experience,",183.85,184.49],["because",184.95,185.29],["next",185.29,185.65],["year",185.65,186.13],["you'll",186.13,186.49],["have",186.49,186.61],["to",186.61,186.75],["do",186.75,186.87],["something",186.87,187.21],["similar",187.21,187.75]]},{"start":187.75,"end":190.51,"text":"for your final dissertation, on a bigger scale.","words":[["for",187.75,187.97],["your",187.97,188.09],["final",188.09,188.43],["dissertation,",188.43,189.05],["on",189.41,189.89],["a",189.89,189.97],["bigger",189.97,190.11],["scale.",190.11,190.51]]},{"start":190.77,"end":191.05,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",190.77,191.05]]},{"start":191.67,"end":194.43,"text":"And what are the variables you'll be looking at?","words":[["And",191.67,192.15],["what",192.15,192.47],["are",192.47,192.61],["the",192.61,192.71],["variables",192.71,193.33],["you'll",193.33,193.77],["be",193.77,193.89],["looking",193.89,194.11],["at?",194.11,194.43]]},{"start":195.01,"end":199.87,"text":"Are you going to look at people's level of education, whether they have a degree for","words":[["Are",195.01,195.23],["you",195.23,195.49],["going",195.49,195.77],["to",195.77,196.03],["look",196.03,196.17],["at",196.17,196.35],["people's",196.35,196.87],["level",196.87,197.05],["of",197.05,197.19],["education,",197.19,197.73],["whether",198.41,198.75],["they",198.75,199.07],["have",199.07,199.31],["a",199.31,199.41],["degree",199.41,199.69],["for",199.69,199.87]]},{"start":199.87,"end":200.27,"text":"example?","words":[["example?",199.87,200.27]]},{"start":200.69,"end":202.93,"text":"I hadn't planned to, do you think I should?","words":[["I",200.69,200.85],["hadn't",200.85,201.09],["planned",201.09,201.39],["to,",201.39,201.87],["do",202.17,202.37],["you",202.37,202.49],["think",202.49,202.59],["I",202.59,202.73],["should?",202.73,202.93]]},{"start":203.57,"end":206.33,"text":"Well, you might see some interesting patterns.","words":[["Well,",203.57,203.95],["you",204.31,204.65],["might",204.65,204.89],["see",204.89,205.17],["some",205.17,205.39],["interesting",205.39,205.89],["patterns.",205.89,206.33]]},{"start":206.83,"end":207.15,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",206.83,207.15]]},{"start":207.61,"end":211.77,"text":"And that'll tie in nicely with my plans to analyse the kind of work people do.","words":[["And",207.61,207.83],["that'll",207.83,208.07],["tie",208.07,208.33],["in",208.33,208.45],["nicely",208.45,208.77],["with",208.77,209.01],["my",209.01,209.21],["plans",209.21,209.57],["to",209.57,209.85],["analyse",209.85,210.21],["t